{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39975","headline":"尚书荣拜恩命夤疾中輙课恶诗二首以申攀赞 二 · 徐夤","name":"尚书荣拜恩命夤疾中輙课恶诗二首以申攀赞 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东郊迎入紫泥封，此日天仙下九重。\n三五月明临阚泽，百千人衆看王恭。\n旗傍绿树遥分影，马蹋浮云不见踪。\n借问乘轺何处客，相庭雄幕卷芙蓉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}